  "next_action": "Keep response-margin as an answer-only development target. Preregister M2-E006 with a deterministic pre-solver proposal/event intervention and capacity-matched sham, first prove nonzero selected-event/chain/path effects mechanically, then use a newly locked development cohort disjoint from M0 and the now-observed E003-E005 cohort. Keep M3 and M8 closed.",
